No law text is published. This repository holds metadata only.

Catalogue entries (chapter, title, enacting and amending Act citations, proclamation and in-force dates) are
facts recorded in the legislative history tables of Manitoba Laws (https://web2.gov.mb.ca/laws/), published
by the King's Printer for Manitoba. No text of any Act is reproduced.

The "legal-system" facts come from Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org), released under CC0 1.0.

Manitoba Laws Copyright Notification (https://www.manitoba.ca/legal/mb_laws.html): "Copyright on the
electronic version of Manitoba laws belongs to the Province of Manitoba. You may, without charge and without
requesting permission, make copies of all or part of any Act or regulation for study or research, or for use
in legal proceedings or for providing legal advice. You must not make copies for any other purpose without
first obtaining the written consent of King's Printer." The Acts are not copied here.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
